		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Nombres de lignes de chaque tables d'une base]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=977#p977"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Parfait Merci<br /> SELECT *<br /> FROM pg_class<br /> JOIN pg_stat_user_tables AS tabstat ON pg_class.relname = tabstat.relname<br /> ORDER BY reltuples DESC<br /> LIMIT 5000</p>]]></content>
